# Backend

Implement `spec/openapi.json` exactly. Keep SQL in `infrastructure/`, rules in `modules/bookings`, HTTP in routes. `Store` is async. Postgres when `DATABASE_URL` is set; SQLite for local fallback and tests.

Return spec status codes (401, 400, 404, 409, 422, 429, 201). Never trust the frontend. Use parameterized queries. Unique confirmed booking per slot.
